WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:19.540
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:41.570
Episode 11
Things I Want to Say

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:03.470
<i>So Shinryuu Shouken didn't 
betray Tanmoku Ki, after all.</i>

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.730
<i>What a heartbreaking reality.</i>

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:13.150
If I hadn't tried to run, 
if I hadn't tried to hurt anyone,

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.620
Shouken wouldn't have had to die.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:20.990
No. This is surely something 
he decided to do in his heart.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.840
Just like a contract to seal time, 
he made a promise with his soul.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.340
He wanted to be your spirit shadow.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.500
But his soul never came to me.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.500
Was it because of this circle?

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.380
The soul-binding circle.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:39.820
Remember this.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:41.830
If you learn this spell,

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.510
you will become the enemy of all 
those with spiritual abilities.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:51.010
This spell was once used 
to make living corpses.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.530
If you use it, it will certainly have a 
reciprocal effect on your body. Understood?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.550
<i>Living corpses?</i>

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.510
In order to keep his body from putrefying,

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:09.660
Shouken's soul has been 
trapped inside his body.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.590
Who's there?!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.260
So this is where you were hiding my brother.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.250
I finally found him.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.680
Shinryuu Sekijin!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.190
Keika!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:34.700
Keika?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.440
Keika...

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.540
You're always by the 
Youmeishi's side, aren't you?

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.940
I'm going to have to separate you two a bit.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.050
Become my puppet.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.270
What the hell?

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:03.880
Why?!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:05.090
Why did you destroy him?!

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:08.540
<i>Was I being controlled all along?</i>

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.480
Keika, what's wrong? Keika!

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:25.900
I filled your body with poison.
One word from me, and you'll go bang.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.450
Keika? Keika!

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:33.470
Keika!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.260
Let's go.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.140
Wait!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:51.640
My lord!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.700
<i>What is happening? My spiritual 
powers aren't working?</i>

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.250
<i>That's weird... There's no one nearby.</i>

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.630
Grandmother?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.630
Grandmother, I'm coming in.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.140
No one's here...

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.140
Ouyou You?

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.080
Where are the members of the Tanmoku family?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.340
What's going on?

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:42.650
How are things with you? I'm at my limit.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.650
You're useless. You're supposed 
to be the best, right?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:47.630
Figure something out.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.620
Only if you kiss me.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:51.620
Stupid!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.710
What happened to the Tanmoku family?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.140
Where's Shinryuu Sekijin? And Shouken?

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:11.950
Keika...

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.660
I thought that if I destroyed that stone, 
it would free you from the poison,

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.650
but I was too naïve.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.500
Tanmoku?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:31.570
Keika, there's something I have to tell you.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.830
Please hurry.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.100
Now that the soul-binding circle has been 
destroyed, his soul doesn't have long.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:45.970
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.100
Running around here like you own the place...

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:58.140
Have you mistaken this mountain 
for the Shinryuu family gardens?

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:05.150
Don't think you're going to be 
leaving here without my permission.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.110
I knew you'd come.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.150
What?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.580
Iku Sashi, return with Shouken.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.620
What about you, my lord?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.160
I have an idea.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.540
Let's do this.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.170
Right!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.740
Capture them!

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:31.180
Wait.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.690
You all are my special chess pieces.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.690
You will be working for me.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.190
Collective hypnosis spell!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.070
Where's the getaway car?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.290
It is arriving.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.850
Once we get down the mountain, it will take 
us straight to the Shinryuu residence.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:03.620
Okay.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.890
Going down the mountain?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.740
You may leave.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.450
But Shouken stays here.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:17.970
Otherwise, I will make you suffer.

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:26.980
When I gave this to you,

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:31.540
you promised me that you would come 
home when your mission was completed.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.470
But all that returned was this key.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.110
Behold.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.080
You didn't keep your promise.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.580
While that boy lived on carefree.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:51.590
So I will wipe your slate clean.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.090
Shinryuu Sekijin!

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:59.610
Impressive, master. You've already 
caught up to me with your dog.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:03.020
You've been quite the show-off. 
I'll hack you to bits!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.850
Accept your punishment.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.100
You're Shouken's brother.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.610
I might be able to reduce your sentence.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:12.610
Oh? You'll make appeals for me?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:16.570
You can still turn back now.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:24.580
Do you even have the strength 
to make me turn back?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.080
That's...

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.210
Tanmoku Ki!

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.300
What have you done to Tanmoku Ki?

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.300
This is the Qian Lunar Mirror.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:39.800
Just like the Kun Solar Ring made by 
the ancestors of the Shinryuu family,

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.050
it is a magical tool to use 
against the Youmeishi.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.310
The Qian Lunar Mirror absorbs 
your spiritual powers,

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:48.310
while the Kun Solar Ring 
restricts your powers.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.320
It would be wise to obey me.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.980
That's why my powers didn't affect you...

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.210
Hey, redhead, what are you trying to pull?

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.260
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.330
No way.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.020
All the players are in place.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.690
Shall we proceed with this 
evening's performance?

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.970
I am not trying to rebel 
against the Tanmoku family.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.020
I just want to take Shouken home.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:45.290
Please, I am begging you. Let us go.

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:50.120
My grandmother saw right through your plan.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:57.760
If you withdraw now, I will let 
you go. But how shameless.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.260
You are the ones who started this!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.880
Shouken leaked information and 
betrayed the Tanmoku family,

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.220
so of course the Tanmoku family 
was going to punish him.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.230
There's no getting through to you, is there?

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:16.730
No. Leave Shouken behind or 
none of you will make it back.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.240
This is...

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.250
So you've finally figured it out.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:30.220
Familiar, isn't it?

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.750
Yes, this is a reenactment of that night.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:39.230
Does it upset you, master? 
I'm sure you're suffering.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:44.220
If we went back to that night, would you be 
able to stand by and watch him die again?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:51.260
There's no point in reenacting 
that moment. Keika is not Shouken!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:54.600
Oh, really?

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.100
<i>Keika?</i>

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:18.090
Why would a lady of the Tanmoku 
family be using talismans?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.090
It's so I don't just kill you. Now move.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:26.170
My lady, you love Shouken, don't you?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:31.060
Then let us go. We're the 
only ones who can save him.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.190
Save him?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:38.570
It's because of your phone call 
that day that he lost his life.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:42.070
I have a reason for that, trust me.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.070
I'm not going to trust you.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.170
Shouken? Shouken!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.210
What should I do? His soul 
is starting to scatter.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.080
Move.

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:02.490
This is your fault. We could 
have saved him, if not for you.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.740
Move!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:07.840
You're going to keep hurting him even now?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:08.970
Out of my way.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.560
This is...

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:37.660
Shouken. Shouken.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.060
My lady?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.230
Where are we?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:55.060
This is my soul ocean.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:03.860
Keika...

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:08.530
Your spirit shadow is just another small fry.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.530
He cannot resist my hypnosis.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:15.040
What do you want, Shinryuu Sekijin?

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.710
I'm giving you a chance.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:24.110
You've seen this nightmare for years, 
and every time, you think the same thing.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:31.010
"I should have been the one to die that day. 
Then Shouken wouldn't have had to die."

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:37.020
"Why am I still alive?
 Shouken should have killed me."

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:42.290
"I should have died. If Shouken 
had gotten to live..."

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.020
Master.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:44.820
Master.

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:51.030
You've known all along that it was 
a mistake that you're still alive.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:56.540
That is why I've set the stage
 and gathered all the players for you.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.980
To make your dream come true.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.550
Now, say it.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:25.520
"Kill me, Shouken."

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.580
Shouken...

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.620
Quite some time has passed and 
much has happened, hasn't it?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.530
How is master doing?

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:45.270
Ki-niisan is fine. Don't worry.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:51.690
But the soul-binding circle has been 
broken and your soul is scattering.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.140
There's only one way to stop it.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:59.240
Do you remember this? 
It's the hair ornament you found for me.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:03.600
I'm still not the Youmeishi yet, so
I can't give you the spirit-binding ring,

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:08.110
but you can use this to temporarily 
become my spirit shadow.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.240
Then your soul won't scatter.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:17.390
I will become the Youmeishi as soon as 
I can, and then we can be together forever.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.180
Why are you appearing as a child, my lady?

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:27.930
A person's spirit appears as they were 
when they shined the most in life.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:31.770
Because this is when you were with me.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:40.100
Please keep this, my lady. 
It is your treasure.

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:45.600
Why? You don't want to be my spirit shadow 
even though your soul will scatter?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:53.610
You said that if I became the Youmeishi, 
we would be together always.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:59.620
Do you know how hard I've worked 
to become the Youmeishi?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.620
How many times I've been brushed aside?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.120
Everything I've done,

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.990
I've done for you.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:58.540
I'm sorry. I wanted to become the master's 
spirit shadow for my own selfish reasons.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.720
I broke the rules and I made a mistake.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:05.230
For me to exist any longer 
would also be a mistake.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.220
But Shouken...

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:14.950
Time has stopped for me, but 
there is still a future for you.

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.240
You will find a wonderful person.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.630
Please keep me in your memory.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.100
Shouken, no!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:31.790
I just have one final request. Please give 
a message to master and my brother.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:37.250
Please.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.100
"Master, wanting to give you forever"

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.770
"was just me being self-important."

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:52.770
"It is no different than what the 
Tanmoku family has done to you."

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:58.280
"The person destined for you 
might still be inexperienced,"

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.750
"but he won't betray you or leave you alone."

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:08.130
"He will be able to go 
with you into the future."

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.430
Impossible. How?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.970
How could you break through my hypnosis?

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:24.950
Your spell is pretty impressive, 
but it won't work on me.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.430
They're able to be controlled by you because

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.440
somewhere deep in their hearts,
 they desire the power of the Youmeishi.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.940
You awakened their desires.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.940
You're a spirit. You're the same as them.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:42.950
You really don't get it. I don't 
want anything from Tanmoku Ki.

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:46.450
Then I'll tell you one thing.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:51.960
Why do you think you feel nothing when 
attacked or stabbed with the Rakugetsu sword?

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:55.960
Because you share the damage 
through the pact connection.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.960
He didn't make a perfect 
pact connection with you.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.700
He's been taking on all the damage himself.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:07.530
Do you know now? You've 
been the one hurting him.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.430
Is that all you have to say?

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:15.340
Let me tell you something, too.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.440
Keika, remember this.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.450
I've never thought of you as a pain,
 nor have I been comparing you to anyone.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.890
I trust you, and I made a contract with you.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.960
I need you, and not just as my spirit shadow.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.460
But...

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:39.460
No matter what happens, don't blame yourself.
 Let's face everything together.

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.590
Okay, then.

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:47.550
We are already one with each other.
 You can't tear us apart.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:56.560
Interesting. Get them!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:05.250
<i>If I get hurt, Tanmoku Ki will 
be the one taking the damage.</i>

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:08.700
<i>There's so many of them and 
that redhead is here, too.</i>

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.700
<i>I won't be able to protect
 Tanmoku Ki if I fight him. Damn it!</i>

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:17.710
A Youmeishi with his spiritual powers 
sealed and an inexperienced spirit shadow.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.240
As long as I have the Qian Lunar 
Mirror and the Kun Solar Ring,

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.550
it is impossible for you to beat me!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.030
What just happened?

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.180
This spiritual power...

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.190
Aren't you forgetting 
something, Lord Shinryuu?

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:48.220
Tanmoku Ki isn't the only 
member of the Tanmoku family.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:26.050
Viewer Submission End Card

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:26.050
Illustrated by: Maru

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:40.080
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:30.880
Why are you so desperate? 
He never cared about you!

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.010
I have a message from Shouken.

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:36.180
Shinryuu Sekijin, you have 
no chance of winning.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>The Bonds That Bind Me</b>

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:40.080
I will obliterate you here and now,
even if it costs me my life!
